      "title": "Institutional Data",
      "url": "https://www.middlebury.edu/assessment-institutional-research/institutional-data",
      "summary": "The Institutional Data page of the Middlebury Institute of International Studies at Monterey provides organized reports by programs, topics, and year, enhancing historical information previously compiled in annual Fact Books. These reports offer insights into various aspects of Middlebury's schools and programs, with continuous updates and additions throughout the academic year. Common Data Sets and other institutional information are made available, helping stakeholders gain a comprehensive understanding of institutional data.",
