      "doc_type": "glossary",
      "title": "Glossary",
      "url": "https://www.middlebury.edu/institute/about/diversity-equity-and-inclusion-dei/glossary",
      "summary": "The glossary provided by the Middlebury Institute of International Studies at Monterey outlines commonly used terms in the context of Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI) work. The definitions aim to support understanding and initiatives in DEI, drawing from various sources to cover a wide array of social justice topics such as ableism, intersectionality, racism, and privilege. The glossary is intended to elucidate the nuances of systemic discrimination and highlight the importance of inclusivity, equity, and intersectional approaches.",
      "stored": false,
