      "doc_type": "strategic_plan",
      "year": 2025,
      "title": "Middlebury’s Strategic Planning Initiative",
      "url": "https://www.middlebury.edu/strategic-planning",
      "summary": "Middlebury's Strategic Planning Initiative aims to rearticulate the institution's mission, purpose, and aspirations for the next decade. Led by a steering committee chaired by Jessica Holmes and AJ Vasiliou, the process involves broad community engagement to identify strategic priorities. The plan will culminate in President Baucom presenting the recommendations to the Board of Trustees in May 2026 for approval.",
